# The Wetlands, Hillsbrad Foothills, then Stormwind and Ironforge, Alliance
# 30 to ~33: the first guide of the 30-40 band.
#
# Forever above level 30 cannot be checked in game until launch on 4
# November: the Wetlands quests below (all new in Forever) and the other
# Forever additions come from the data (Questie Forever, Wowhead Forever),
# not from play.
#
# Flow: Menethil Harbor (where 07-thousand-needles ends, on its hearth) ->
# Whelgar's Excavation Site -> the Green Belt (Howin Kindfeather, Rethiel) ->
# the Angerfang Encampment -> Golm in the south-east -> the Dragonmaw Gates
# -> the whelps, raptors and Neru in the north-east -> the Green Belt -> Dun
# Modr and the Villards by the Thandol Span -> Whelgar -> Menethil -> boat to
# Southshore (Farren's murlocs and naga, the turtles, the Syndicate camp on
# the Alterac border, the yeti cave, Hillsbrad's town hall) -> fly to
# Stormwind for a round of turn-ins and the Missing Diplomat chain (Druids
# train there) -> Deeprun Tram to Ironforge for Stormpike, the Reclaimers,
# King Magni, Historian Karnik and class training -> next guide: Desolace.
#
# The Wetlands (consensus visit 14, 30.1-31.4, all Alliance starts): added in
# this refresh at the start of this guide, one loop out of Menethil and back.
# 07-thousand-needles keeps the classic Wetlands quests (the Third Fleet, the
# dig, the Dragonmaw banners) and now ends on its hearth to Menethil; the
# boat to Southshore, its flight path, bind and The Shamed Lieutenant (98219)
# turn-in moved here.
# - Added: This Land Was Their Land (98230), Crocs of
#   the Sky (98072), Understanding Our Present (98216), Gleaning Our Future
#   (98310), For Further Study (98313, to Historian Karnik), Razormaw Needling
#   (98245), Word to Ironforge (98300, to King Magni), Old Habits (98223),
#   Spark of Freedom (87491) and Hearts of the Lost (87318).
# - Carnage (98283) is optional: Wowhead Forever lists it as an elite quest.
# - Apart from Stopping the Cycle (below), the data has no prerequisites
#   inside these chains; For Further Study and Word to Ironforge are taken
#   on the way back, after the quests they most likely follow, so either
#   order works. Word to Ironforge is optional: one list puts it after a
#   quest the route leaves out, and no second source settles it, so the
#   turn-in holds only players who took it.
# - Left out, as each is the last part of a chain whose earlier part the
#   route cannot place (the quest chains foreverchanges.pro shows from
#   Wowhead's Forever database, checked 2026-10-17; the data has no
#   prerequisite, and no spawns for the objects the earlier part asks for):
#   Bloom of the Heavens (98209, Sylessa Duskwhisper's
#   delivery to Auberdine) comes after Bloom of the Heavens (98208, recover
#   Nord'el from the Flying Osprey wreck south of Menethil), and Sentiments of
#   the Lost (88758, Essene's note to Corma) after Accessories of the Lost
#   (88757, an elite quest for Essene's necklace, spellbook and waterskin).
# - Left out: Crimson Crate Delivery (98240): by its text it comes after Crocs
#   of the Sky, which is handed in back in Menethil, and it ends at Howin in
#   the Green Belt: a second ride across the zone for 1200 XP. Horrors in the
#   Highland (95646): its Highland Horror lives in the Excavation Site:
#   Wetlands dungeon (dungeon journal). Stopping the Cycle (98297): Howin
#   offers it only after Death to the Dragonmaw (98291, Wowhead Forever
#   comments, #51), whose Dragonmaw Retreat orcs are elite (Wowhead Forever,
#   in corrections.json), so the simulator leaves 98291 out.
# - Nek'rosh's Gambit (465) comes from 07-thousand-needles, which takes it
#   after From the Ashes (98221, Forever puts it between War Banners and
#   465; issue #225): the Dragonmaw catapult is lit on the way from Howin to
#   the Angerfang Encampment.
# Hillsbrad (consensus visit 15): added Hillsbrad's Hoard (98059, Forever): the
# data has no bookkeeping table, so the step points at the town hall where
# Magistrate Burnside and the councilmen stand; it is walked on the way back
# from the yeti cave. Talk of the Town (98463, Forever) is a breadcrumb from
# Barkeep Kelly to Booty Bay, handed in at 04-stranglethorn-vale.
#
# Deviations from the simulator route (consensus, Alliance Human):
# - Every Southshore quest is picked up on arrival instead of after Farren's
#   chain: same hub, no extra walk.
# - Stormwind: the turn-ins run as one loop (Trade District, Old Town, the
#   Keep, the Cathedral, the Mage Quarter, back through the Trade District to
#   the tram). The route's Stormwind bind and its hearth back into the same
#   city are dropped: the next bind (Nijel's Point) replaces it before use.
# - The route binds at Nijel's Point while still in Ironforge (a model
#   shortcut): the bind is in the next guide, on arrival.
# - Southshore on arrival, in walking order from the boat: McManus, the
#   flight master, Micha, Bartolo, Darren, the inn (Farren, Kelly, Jessen),
#   Phin, Maleb, Jacques.
# Carried on to later guides: Costly Menace (564), Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak
# (565), Hints of a New Plague? (659), An Alarming Request (92432), Noble
# Deaths (512), Further Mysteries (525), Malin's Request (690), James Hyal
# (1301), The Doomed Fleet (270) and The Missing Diplomat (1248), all turned
# in later on the route.
# Class quests: Warriors take The Islander (1718) from Wu Shen in Stormwind;
# Fray Island lies on the ride to Ratchet in 40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale,
# where Big Will (level 33) is no longer a risk. Warlocks: Seeking Strahad
# and the Felhunter's Tome of the Cabal (1798 onwards) are not taken here:
# forever/class/warlock/felhunter-alliance has the chain.
# Left out: A Noble Brew (335, 336): a cellar stop and a walk to the Keep's
# far side for little XP; dropped for flow.
# Not here: Return to Milton (542), Dark Council (537) and Stormpike's
# Deciphering (554) cannot be taken in this guide: their prerequisites (540,
# 525, 551) are turned in later, in 05-arathi-highlands, which carries all
# three.
guide forever/alliance/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills
title Wetlands, Hillsbrad Foothills, Ironforge & Stormwind City
faction Alliance
levels 30-33
zone Wetlands
next forever/alliance/30-40/02-desolace

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Menethil Harbor

step Menethil Harbor
  tip Captain Stoutfist stands in Menethil Keep; James Halloran stands by the north gate.
  accept 98230                        -- Captain Stoutfist: for Howin Kindfeather
  accept 98072                        -- James Halloran

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Whelgar's Excavation Site

step Prospector Whelgar
  tip Follow the road east to Whelgar's Excavation Site.
  accept 98216

step Goaz Warder
  tip The Goaz Warders stand just west of Whelgar's camp: use the Goaz Stone he gave you beside one.
  collect 279993 quest 98216.1        -- Titanic Keystone

step Prospector Whelgar
  turnin 98216
  accept 98310                        -- A new Goaz Stone, for the four titan watchers around the Wetlands

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Green Belt

step The Green Belt
  tip Follow the road north-east into the Green Belt: Howin Kindfeather camps beside it, Rethiel the Greenwarden a short way east.
  turnin 98230                        -- Howin Kindfeather
  accept 98245
  accept 98283 optional               -- Rethiel the Greenwarden: Carnage, an elite raptor

step Angerfang Encampment
  tip South to the Dragonmaw's Angerfang Encampment: the first catapult stands on the way, and the Tattered Spellbook lies in the camp.
  turnin 465                          -- Dragonmaw Catapult
  note The next step, Defeat Nek'rosh, pits you against an elite chieftain: skip it.
  accept 98223 object 671518          -- Tattered Spellbook: for Captain Stoutfist

step Golm
  tip Golm stands in the south-eastern hills: use the Goaz Stone beside it.
  collect 280397 quest 98310.3        -- Heart of Golm

step Dragonmaw Gates
  tip North-east to the Dragonmaw Gates: Ados stands at the gates (use the Goaz Stone).
  collect 280395 quest 98310.1        -- Heart of Ados

step Whelps, raptors and Neru
  tip Red whelps fill the hills west of the gates, Maddened Rotclaws the Green Belt, Razormaws the northern slopes; Neru stands in the north-east (use the Goaz Stone).
  tip Carnage is elite: grouping up is advised.
  collect 279385 quest 98072.1        -- Pristine Crimson Scale
  collect 280103 quest 98245.1        -- Razormaw Incisor
  collect 280398 quest 98310.4        -- Heart of Neru
  collect 280331 quest 98283.1 optional -- Malignant Rotclaw Flesh
  collect 280330 quest 98283.2 optional -- Carnage's Head

step The Green Belt
  turnin 98245                        -- Howin Kindfeather
  accept 98300 optional               -- For King Magni in Ironforge, at the end of this guide
  turnin 98283 optional               -- Rethiel the Greenwarden

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Dun Modr

step Dun Modr
  tip North along the road to Dun Modr. Modr stands in the ruins (use the Goaz Stone); the Captive Fire Elemental is held on the west side: lead it out to Roggo Harlbarrow.
  collect 280396 quest 98310.2        -- Heart of Modr
  accept 87491                        -- Captive Fire Elemental
  turnin 87491                        -- Roggo Harlbarrow

step The Villards
  tip Comar Villard waits north of Dun Modr by the Thandol Span; Essene a short walk further north-east.
  accept 87318                        -- Comar Villard
  turnin 87318                        -- Essene Villard

step Prospector Whelgar
  tip Back south down the road to the excavation site.
  turnin 98310
  accept 98313                        -- For Historian Karnik in Ironforge, at the end of this guide

step Menethil Harbor
  tip West along the road to Menethil.
  turnin 98223
  turnin 98072                        -- James Halloran

step Boat to Southshore
  goto 4.78,57.02 "Boat to Southshore"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Southshore

step Southshore
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Pick up everything in town before heading out. Off the boat, Captain McManus is the first you meet, north-west of the flight master; Micha Yance and Bartolo Ginsetti stand between the flight master and the inn, Farren and Barkeep Kelly at the inn, Maleb in the town hall.
  accept 98059                        -- Captain McManus
  getfp "Southshore" npc 2432         -- Darla Harris
  buy 3713 x1 npc 2381                -- Soothing Spices, from Micha Yance
  accept 565                          -- Bartolo Ginsetti
  accept 564                          -- Darren Malvew: the lions come later
  sethome "Southshore" npc 2352       -- Innkeeper Anderson
  turnin 98219 npc 2228               -- Lieutenant Farren Orinelle
  accept 536                          -- Lieutenant Farren Orinelle
  accept 98463                        -- Barkeep Kelly, in the inn: for Booty Bay (04-stranglethorn-vale)
  accept 555                          -- Chef Jessen
  accept 659                          -- Phin Odelic: his trail leads to Arathi
  accept 505                          -- Magistrate Henry Maleb
  # An Alarming Request requires level 30 (Wowhead Forever quest=92432, checked 2026-10-14).
  accept 92432 "An Alarming Request" npc 247264 lvl 30 -- Emissary Jacques

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The coast

step Torn Fin murlocs
  tip The Torn Fin murlocs crowd the Western Strand, south-west of Southshore.
  kill 2377 quest 536.1               -- Torn Fin Tidehunter
  kill 2376 quest 536.2               -- Torn Fin Oracle

step Farren
  turnin 536
  accept 559

step Murloc heads
  tip Back to the same murlocs; not every one drops a head.
  collect 3716 quest 559              -- Murloc Head

step Farren's Proof
  turnin 559                          -- Lieutenant Farren Orinelle
  accept 560
  turnin 560                          -- Marshal Redpath
  accept 561
  turnin 561                          -- Lieutenant Farren Orinelle
  accept 562

step Daggerspine naga
  tip The naga hold the shore south-east of Southshore.
  kill 2369 quest 562.1               -- Daggerspine Shorehunter
  kill 2371 quest 562.2               -- Daggerspine Siren

step Farren
  turnin 562
  accept 563                          -- A report for Stormwind Keep

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North of Southshore

step Snapjaws
  tip The Snapjaw turtles bask along the river east of Southshore, south of Tarren Mill (Horde).
  collect 3712 quest 555              -- Turtle Meat

step Syndicate camp
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip The Syndicate camp sits on the Alterac border in northern Hillsbrad, west of Tarren Mill (Horde); the documents lie in the camp.
  kill 2241 quest 505.2               -- Syndicate Thief
  kill 2240 quest 505.1               -- Syndicate Footpad
  accept 510 object 1738              -- Syndicate Documents
  accept 511 object 1738

step Yeti cave
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip The yetis live in the cave in the hills north of Southshore, on your way back south.
  collect 3720 quest 565.4            -- Yeti Fur
  note Bartolo also wants a Hillman's Cloak, a Bolt of Woolen Cloth and Fine Thread: crafted or bought; the cloak is turned in when you are back in Southshore later.

step Hillsbrad's town hall
  tip West to the farms of Hillsbrad: place the Sealed Company Request on the bookkeeping table in the town hall, where Magistrate Burnside and the councilmen stand.
  goto 29.7,41.6 "Hillsbrad town hall"

step Southshore
  turnin 98059                        -- Captain McManus
  turnin 555                          -- Chef Jessen
  turnin 511                          -- Loremaster Dibbs
  accept 514
  turnin 505                          -- Magistrate Henry Maleb
  turnin 510
  accept 512

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stormwind

step Fly to Stormwind
  zone Stormwind City
  fly "Stormwind"                     -- From Darla Harris in Southshore

step Elling Trias
  tip The cheese shop in the Trade District.
  turnin 1245
  accept 1246

step Dashel Stonefist
  tip Dashel waits in the Pig and Whistle tavern in Old Town; he and his two thugs fight you, but stop once beaten.
  turnin 1246
  accept 1447
  complete 1447
  turnin 1447
  accept 1247

step The Islander
  only Warrior
  tip Wu Shen trains warriors in Old Town, beside the Pig and Whistle. Klannoc Macleod waits on Fray Island in the Barrens, on the way to Ratchet much later (40-50/01).
  accept 1718 npc 5479                -- Wu Shen

step Stormwind Keep
  turnin 563                          -- Major Samuelson

step Cathedral of Light
  turnin 293                          -- Archbishop Benedictus
  turnin 269                          -- Bishop Farthing
  accept 270

step Mage Quarter
  tip Archmage Malin is in the Slaughtered Lamb; Garion Wendell near the canal; Connor Rivers south of the Mage Quarter.
  accept 690                          -- Archmage Malin
  accept 79536                        -- Garion Wendell
  turnin 79536
  accept 1301                         -- Connor Rivers

step Elling Trias
  turnin 1247
  accept 1248

step Druid training
  only Druid
  tip Ironforge has no druid trainer: train with Sheldras Moontree in Stormwind before the tram.
  train class

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step Deeprun Tram
  zone Ironforge
  tip Take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge.
  turnin 514                          -- Prospector Stormpike, Hall of Explorers
  turnin 98313                        -- Historian Karnik, Hall of Explorers
  turnin 98300                        -- King Magni Bronzebeard, the High Seat
  accept 525
  accept 1453                         -- Roetten Stonehammer
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock -- Level 30 and 32 spells
